<title>POLAND: BIG NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 4.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>BIG NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 4.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.69 vs    6.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    4.69 vs    6.31</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  3.81 vs   48.12</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	30.44 vs   67.71</p>
<p>OCTOBER-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  9.29 vs   15.00</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    9.29 vs   15.00</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.58 vs   68.31</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	61.78 vs  103.58</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Inicjatyw</p>
<p>Gospodarczych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
